# ─── GreenGuard CODEOWNERS ────────────────────────────────────────
# Routes review requests by area of ownership.
#
# NOTE ON PRECEDENCE: the LAST matching pattern wins, and only that rule's
# owners are requested. A path rule therefore OVERRIDES the `*` default
# rather than adding to it — which is why the team lead is listed explicitly
# on every rule, not just the default. Without that, the lead cannot satisfy
# a CODEOWNERS review on paths they do not appear in.
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default — team lead owns anything not otherwise claimed
